				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Verissimam esse Christi sententiam modo ipse experientia didici, ornatissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>: "Ubi thesaurus tuus est, ibi et cor tuum erit."</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Iam sesqui<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>anno totus fui in ędificando, non in thesauri collectione, sed profusione, verum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tamen sollicitus, ne inutiles sumptus facerem adeoque thesauriolam dependerem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>non solum omnes meditationes animi in eam actionem defixi necnon <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>etiam subinde ipsas manus operi admovi, ut meo exemplo aliis calcaria <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>subderem; sed tardigradi aselli calcaribus adactis citius retro quam progrediunt<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">His molestiis implicitus indignis libero homine omnes amicos defrauda<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>vi nec secundum amicitie leges offitia debita et obsequia rependi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Verum, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quia gravi necessitatis telo confixus, non negligentia aut socordia desig[nat<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>am] stationem intermisi, spero me dominationem tuam et alios amicos habiturum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>iudices ęquiores, ut qui relequata debita cum fęnore dependere constituerim <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>deinceps etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>De nostra <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> novi nihil, quod tibi incognitum suspicer, adeoque ex <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>eventu pendemus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Utinam toti regno felici faustuque in nostram <placeName ref="l632">Alsati<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>am</placeName> modo conveniunt equites mille; ab iis principibus et statibus, qui in <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>circul <placeName>Rhenano</placeName> sunt, missi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8371">Albertus</persName> quidem marchio prętexitur, ut<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>qui excursiones in <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensem</placeName> episcopatum propediem facturus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed non sunt heę verę, quę sparguntur nuptię.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Eques secundum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallie</placeName> limitem collocatus inhibiturus tam <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> transitionem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quam regiorum in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> accessionem, et quoniam bellica <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>consilia et apparatus plerumque et hyeme fiunt, ideo eques in eas excub<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ias designatus est, non stipendiis m[archionis], sed totius circuli contribu<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tionibus alendus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tum is quoque eques, prout commodum visum fuerit, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>plus ultra procedet; ita ex aliena fidelia proprii parietes dealbantur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> hoc tempore nihil habet novi; <persName>Augustus</persName>, <persName>Mauritii</persName> frater, vale<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tudinarius est et qui ad pedopyan inutilis existimatur, adeoque <persName>Ioannis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Frederici</persName> liberi in universum <placeName ref="l749">Saxonie</placeName> ducatum succesuri sperantur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Mirum, si hęc hyems non paritura sit iam olim parturita comitia, ut im<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>perium in belli societatem pelliciatur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Commenda me tuis generis.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Si qua <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>re dominationi tę gratificari potero, faciam sedulo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>26. septembris 1554.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p8121">C[<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>a<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>ro<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>l<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>s<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>] <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Mo<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>ntiu<lb xml:id="p2z33"/>s</persName><lb xml:id="p2z34"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
